<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#080c14"><title>Google Growth Integration — VANNDIK</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#080c14;color:#e9f1ff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 0%,#1769ff18,transparent 40%),#080c14;min-height:100vh}.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:32px 22px 70px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:32px}.brand{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px}.brand span{color:#55baff}a{color:#9bb4d5;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#5abaff;font-weight:700}.heading{font-size:34px;margin:10px 0}.sub{color:#91a2bb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;max-width:700px}.panel{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111a29,#0c121e);border:1px solid #26364d;border-radius:10px;padding:22px;margin-top:16px}.panel h2{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}.muted{font-size:11px;color:#8397b2;line-height:1.8}.status{padding:12px;border:1px solid #31496a;border-radius:8px;color:#9bb4d5;font-size:12px;margin-top:14px}.status.ok{border-color:#286b58;color:#9ae5c8}.status.bad{border-color:#74434a;color:#ffb3b3}.btn{display:inline-flex;border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:11px 16px;background:#1769ff;color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px}.btn.secondary{background:#1a2b43;border:1px solid #38516f}.field{display:grid;gap:7px;margin:15px 0}.field label{font-size:11px;color:#a9bbd3}.field input{width:100%;padding:12px;background:#0a1220;border:1px solid #31435d;border-radius:7px;color:#eef5ff;font-size:13px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px}.metrics{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}.metric{background:#0a1423;border:1px solid #273a53;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;min-width:145px}.metric b{display:block;font-size:23px;margin-top:6px}.metric span{font-size:10px;color:#91a2bb}.warning{color:#f3c98c}.report{font-size:12px;color:#b9c9df;line-height:1.8}.hidden{display:none}@media(max-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:22px 15px}}
</style></head><body><main class="wrap">
<div class="top"><div class="brand">VANNDIK<span>.</span> INTELLIGENCE</div><a href="/admin/growth/">← Kembali ke Growth</a></div>
<div class="eyebrow">GOOGLE DATA CONNECTION</div><h1 class="heading">Search Console & Analytics</h1><p class="sub">Hubungkan akun Google untuk membaca performa Search Console, GA4, dan YouTube Analytics (termasuk YouTube Shorts). Akses bersifat read-only; persetujuan ulang mungkin diperlukan untuk menambahkan izin YouTube.</p>
<section class="panel"><h2>1. Koneksi akun Google</h2><p class="muted">Gunakan akun pemilik VANNDIK: dickv940@gmail.com. OAuth meminta akses read-only untuk Search Console, GA4, dan laporan YouTube Analytics. Tidak meminta akses untuk mengunggah atau mengubah video.</p><div id="connection" class="status">Memeriksa konfigurasi…</div><button class="btn" id="connect">Hubungkan akun Google</button></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>2. Pilih properti website</h2><p class="muted">Isi nilai yang sudah terdaftar pada akun Google yang sama. Search Console menerima format Domain property atau URL-prefix property. GA4 menggunakan angka Property ID, bukan Measurement ID (G-XXXX).</p>
<div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="site">Search Console property</label><input id="site" placeholder="sc-domain:vanndik.pages.dev atau https://vanndik.pages.dev/"></div><div class="field"><label for="ga4">GA4 Property ID</label><input id="ga4" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Contoh: 123456789"></div></div><button class="btn secondary" id="save">Simpan properti</button><span id="saveStatus" class="muted"></span></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>3. Ambil laporan</h2><p class="muted">Data pencarian dan analytics akan diminta langsung dari Google saat tombol dijalankan. Tidak ada biaya layanan VANNDIK untuk membaca API ini selama kuota gratis Google mencukupi.</p><button class="btn" id="report">Ambil data 30 hari</button><div id="reportBox" class="report"></div></section>
<div class="status warning">Catatan setup: sebelum menghubungkan, aktifkan Google Search Console API dan Google Analytics Data API di Google Cloud. Anda dapat memakai OAuth client yang sama dengan integrasi Google Drive VANNDIK; cukup tambahkan URL callback <b>https://vanndik.pages.dev/api/cms/google-growth/callback</b> ke Authorized redirect URIs. Integrasi memakai secret Google Drive yang sudah digunakan CMS. Setelah menambah scope YouTube, hubungkan ulang akun Google dan setujui akses baca yang diminta. Jangan pernah membagikan Client Secret di chat.</div>
</main>
<script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),fmt=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID').format(n||0);
async function api(path,options={}){const r=await fetch('/api/cms/google-growth/'+path,{credentials:'same-origin',...options,headers:{...(options.headers||{}),...(options.body?{'content-type':'application/json'}:{})}});const d=await r.json().catch(()=>({}));if(r.status===401){location.href='/admin/';throw Error('Sesi admin berakhir.')}if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Permintaan gagal');return d}
async function load(){try{const d=await api('status');$('connection').textContent=d.connected?'Terhubung sebagai '+d.email+' sejak '+new Date(d.connectedAt).toLocaleString('id-ID'):(d.configured?'Belum terhubung. Siap menghubungkan akun Google.':'Konfigurasi OAuth belum lengkap.');$('connection').className='status '+(d.connected?'ok':'bad');$('connect').disabled=!d.configured;$('connect').textContent=d.configured?'Hubungkan akun Google':'Menunggu konfigurasi Cloudflare';$('site').value=d.searchConsoleSite||'';$('ga4').value=d.ga4PropertyId||''}catch(e){$('connection').textContent=e.message;$('connection').className='status bad'}}
$('connect').onclick=()=>{location.href='/api/cms/google-growth/connect'};
$('save').onclick=async()=>{try{await api('config',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({searchConsoleSite:$('site').value,ga4PropertyId:$('ga4').value})});$('saveStatus').textContent='Properti berhasil disimpan.'}catch(e){$('saveStatus').textContent=e.message}};
$('report').onclick=async()=>{const box=$('reportBox');box.textContent='Mengambil data dari Google…';try{const d=await api('report?days=30');let html='';if(d.searchConsole)html+='<div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>Search clicks</span><b>'+fmt(d.searchConsole.clicks)+'</b></div><div class="metric"><span>Search impressions</span><b>'+fmt(d.searchConsole.impressions)+'</b></div></div>';if(d.analytics)html+='<div class="metrics">'+d.analytics.totals.map(x=>'<div class="metric"><span>'+x.metric+'</span><b>'+fmt(x.value)+'</b></div>').join('')+'</div>';if(d.youtube)html+='<h3>YouTube Shorts · '+d.youtube.startDate+'—'+d.youtube.endDate+'</h3><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>Shorts views</span><b>'+fmt(d.youtube.shortsViews)+'</b></div><div class="metric"><span>Watch minutes</span><b>'+fmt(d.youtube.watchMinutes)+'</b></div><div class="metric"><span>Subscriber gained</span><b>'+fmt(d.youtube.subscribersGained)+'</b></div></div>';if(d.warnings.length)html+='<p class="warning">'+d.warnings.map(x=>String(x).replace(/[&<>"]/g,'')).join('<br>')+'</p>';if(!html)html='Belum ada data yang dapat ditampilkan. Periksa akses properti.';box.innerHTML=html}catch(e){box.textContent=e.message}};
const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search);if(params.has('google_connected'))history.replaceState({},'',location.pathname);if(params.has('google_error')){$('connection').textContent='Koneksi Google gagal: '+params.get('google_error');$('connection').className='status bad';history.replaceState({},'',location.pathname)}load();
</script></body></html>